{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（15日）上午9時半，警方接報，一輛貨車沿順朗路往九龍方向行駛，期間駛至一條支路時，突然失控翻側，車內司機及乘客一度被困，其後自行爬出車外。意外中有10米路面被刮花，無人受傷。</p><p>網上圖片可見，密斗貨車翻側橫亘路中，有零件飛脫。</p><figure><img alt=\"網上圖片可見，密斗貨車翻側橫亘路中，有零件飛脫。（James Chan/車cam L（香港群組）圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198641008485601280013278.jpeg/BgDjn7bS7c2GIfmVahAzI7MRcx3wJJUE7vvXeu7713o\"/><figcaption>網上圖片可見，密斗貨車翻側橫亘路中，有零件飛脫。（James Chan/車cam L（香港群組）圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:36:36.317134+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T06:28:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T21:01:27.335481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T06:30:17.021609+00:00","content_hash":"ae0e200691499f9763a63b0fe002ecf15a3ae5bdb5167a0c9e34e73af67f84c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}